  "annotations_dropped": [
    {
      "annotation_id": "0f1d2604b3874c91a79982ab268694ba_11",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Mr. Dash submitted that the data of the rest 44 wards of C.M.C. relating to road conditions and other civic amenities issues will be handed over to Mr.\nDebasis Nayak-A, learned counsel for the C.M.C. in course of the day."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2f2f5edf8830449a99b1db333085a9b6_12",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Mr. Anam Charan Patra, C.M.C. Commissioner appearing in person submitted that for the road repair works of the 15 wards, estimate has been prepared and Junior Engineers have been asked to take up the works and in one of the wards, the road "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5ea18ed4e4ba4caabd3faba6e47735bc_13",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "So far as the rest 44 wards are concerned which list they are supposed to receive today from the learned President of the Orissa High Court Bar Association, works will be distributed among the Junior Engineers and similar steps are to be ta"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "05acdbe9335c484992945b8ae5dbaa2b_35",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nSince few days are left for commencement of Durga Puja Festival, we expect that the C.M.C.\nauthorities along with the authorities of other departments who are concerned with the civic issues of Cuttack City shall make a conjoint effort to "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bbadad869b6d4f24a64896f4dc1d4afb_36",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThe personal appearance of the Principal Secretary, Works Department and the Collector, Cuttack are dispensed with for the time being."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "03226be695a04272899941a199be1698_40",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Professor Dr. Lucy Das, Dean and Superintendent in-charge, S.C.B.M.C.H. appeared in Court and she has filed point wise compliance status of remedial measures suggested by Advocates'\nCommittee."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "89ed11a345044a83bf958c6ee42ebc04_41",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The present status of each of the works has been highlighted in it."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7b21781273ea4990b351cfe9892f7fe5_42",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The same is taken on record."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3fa74e18a366458f8629691ba6fc755c_43",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Mr. Bijay Kumar Dash, learned President of the OHCBA, filed an additional report on the findings of post-mortem centre and other wards wherein it has been highlighted that one Aahar Centre is being operated in the campus of S.C.B.M.C.H. whi"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a8880d62b4a64ab495cb4f2a3dd96661_44",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The attendants of the patients have brought to their notice that they have to wait hours together in a line to have their meals but when their turn comes, they often find that no food is left."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5ad216df1a2b44e6959820f1168df18a_45",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nIt has been suggested that one more Aahar Centre should be opened and it is to be seen that hygienic food are served in the centre."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "47191ff5b7774395b9ab45a8b42bc937_46",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Suggestion has been given to open a Mission Shakti Caf inside the campus so that no outsiders would enter the campus for marketing the fast foods."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "55292a56f2434615b283886f6abe9b1a_47",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further suggestion has been given regarding facilities of visitors card and to fix visiting hours to check the crowd congregation inside the campus."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cca14db8605640ef9b1d691f54026695_48",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The additional report is taken on record."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "97ecca06a15b4b2badbdc9ed7ac2d450_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "A copy of the additional report has been handed over to Professor Dr. Lucy Das, who has assured this Court to look into these issues."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5765f7380df349f18044c39c3e93bba4_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nMr. Dash, the learned President has also placed a note relating to mismanagement of health service in S.C.B.M.C.H. which is taken on record."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f28089d13e9c4d9fbda2dc30a52eff12_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is stated therein, inter alia, that no faculty member is attending the outdoor duty after 2.00 p.m. in various departments and that the Associate and Assistant Professors (Unit Head) are not attending the outdoor regularly both in the fi"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7461905524e24a248d944058a6ba6dbe_53",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nA copy of the note has been served on Professor Dr. Lucy Das and she has assured this Court to look into these aspects and apprise this Court on the next date."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "781fb43740374a49b8bd04305f1eb96a_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "When a news item published today was noticed that patient care in Govt. hospitals have been partially hit as nurses have gone on strike, Professor Das stated that alternative arrangements have already been made and outsourcing services have"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7399410517d944469d11ff5c39f2db5c_55",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "She submitted that the requirements under different headings have been conveyed to different departments."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ddbdb9165c334e8fb9de07b005616881_56",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nLet Professor Das file a note as to what are the pending works of S.C.B.M.C.H. which have been communicated to which departments and when."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2b9e74c5b55542228db7770dfd35f439_57",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nSmt. Aswathy S., I.A.S., Health Secretary, Odisha appeared through virtual mode and submitted that steps are being taken on regular basis to sort out different problems relating to infrastructure,\nshortage of doctors, staff and she further"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f855ec2d299740b3af142daf09e18a1a_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThe Court fervently hopes that issue relating to the grievances of the nursing employees would be addressed on priority basis keeping in view their pivotal role in health care."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4169ba9c922a484b98cbf5f78554ce8d_59",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nIt is stated that 'health is wealth'."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0202cda6503e4ddfa814090ba2866824_60",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is the obligation of the State to ensure the condition congenial to good health."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c89a9e477c26490a9cbc9582ab2b50a8_61",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Right to health is a fundamental right."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a55517ce83714003979b1d2df634b01e_62",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Facilities of health and medical care are essential for a citizen to remain physically and mentally fit."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3c2c3f2288324d289f2e68b871cc8567_63",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In view of Article 21 so also Article 47 of the Constitution of India, it is the primary duty of the State to secure good health for its citizens and therefore maintenance and improvement of public health facilities are to be ranked higher "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1048b41401e14b9aa9c2ca4fb76472ba_71",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is stated that all the IICs of Cuttack City have been directed to undertake awareness programmes in their respective police station jurisdiction to sensitize different Puja Committee as well as general public not to play loud music durin"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a6826e2ef97c45819def18d3eaf86199_72",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nSome learned Members of the Bar have expressed serious concern in the manner the Chandini Chowk Puja Committee so also other Puja Committees of Cuttack City have started construction of puja mandaps on the public road which are leading to "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ea6479c5cddd40b999338848f4997e2b_73",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Collector, Cuttack has assured this Court that immediate steps shall be taken by deputing teams to visit each puja mandap to check such illegal construction activities on the public road and if necessary, the licence granted shall be re"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6000437224f94e108f7a16f561456376_75",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is stated that in addition to three numbers of existing fire stations in Cuttack City, additional six numbers of temporary fire stations will be opened and bike patrolling units and quick response units will be placed at large gathering "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a5d0319d2abb42f790b44287396f1598_77",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nWe expect that appropriate steps as suggested by the D.C.P., Cuttack so also the Asst. Fire Officer in their affidavits would be effectively implemented so that the people would enjoy Puja in a better manner."
    }
  ],
